      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Value for break strategy indicating balanced line breaking. The line breaker does whole-paragraph optimization for making all lines similar length, and also applies automatic hyphenation when required. This break strategy is good for small screen devices such as watch screens.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/text/LineBreaker#BREAK_STRATEGY_BALANCED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.text.LineBreaker.BREAK_STRATEGY_BALANCED</code>.</a></format></para>
