      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Value for break strategy indicating simple line breaking. The line breaker puts words to the line as much as possible and breaks line if no more words can fit into the same line. Automatic hyphens are only added when a line has a single word and that word is longer than line width. This is the fastest break strategy and ideal for editor.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/text/LineBreaker#BREAK_STRATEGY_SIMPLE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.text.LineBreaker.BREAK_STRATEGY_SIMPLE</code>.</a></format></para>
